PlayTown — Child Safety Standards (CSAE)
Last updated: 10 November 2026

PlayTown is a sports community platform. We prohibit child sexual abuse and exploitation (CSAE), including child sexual abuse material (CSAM), grooming, sexual solicitation of minors, and any content or conduct that exploits or endangers children.
Prohibited content and behavior
Users must not upload, share, request, promote, or distribute CSAM or other content involving the sexual exploitation of minors. Attempts to groom, solicit, coerce, threaten, or exploit minors are prohibited. We do not permit accounts or communities to facilitate such activity.
Reporting safety concerns
